    "description": "Helped to design and implement an in-house JWT-based authentication microservice to replace Auth0. Added support for password login, passwordless login, and SSO for major IDP's like Okta and Microsoft AD. SSO implementation supports just-in-time-provisioning as well as de-provisioning.",
